<title>MACAU: Macau's Feb unemployment rate falls to 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Macau's Feb unemployment rate falls to 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MACAU 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macau's unemployment rate in February was 3.4 percent, lower than January's 3.8 percent, the Portuguese-administered enclave's statistics and census department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>But underemployment was up slightly in February at 0.6 percent versus 0.5 percent in January, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2943 6441</p>
</text>
